    {
      "id": "gapsText",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 1110,
      "height": 225,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "text": "KNOWN GAPS — must close before production (10, from CLAUDE.md)\n\nGo Backend (3): no RAG-based skill filtering, all skills load always  ·  model routing classifier absent  ·  skills all-or-nothing per agent config\n\nLocal Daemon (5): no watchdog — hung CLI agent stalls forever  ·  CleanupRuntimeConfig() only runs on happy path, needs Go defer  ·  workspace isolation under concurrency=6 unconfirmed  ·  no mid-execution token budget kill-switch  ·  BuildPrompt() output not logged\n\nOrchestrator (2): not wired into Stage 4 completion flow — status=completed fires with zero SE review  ·  Lark bidirectionality unconfirmed, may be outbound-only",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-05T07:20:56.144Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-05T07:20:56.144Z",
      "version": 1
    }
